            "review_text": "Faith_Liu\nSingapore, Singapore120 contributions\n0\nFor shell fish lovers!\nDec 2016 • Friends\nRead about it online and the writer was brought here by a local so we figured it should be authentic. We showed the waiter the pictures of the dishes we wanted, although we realised there were some local favourites which were not in the list. We ordered bread and wanted something we could dip the bread into and the waiter just asked us 'I get you the most popular dish for our shop?'. It turned out great! Although communication was a little bit tricky (we tried to ordered 2 soup but got 2 porridge instead) but it was good fun and the food was quite delicious. There were many locals eating there and made for an authentic Vietnamese experience. Recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 11, 2016",
