            "review_text": "Pink Lys\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam142 contributions\n0\nGood choice for shellfish!\nAug 2016 • Friends\nOc Khanh is located on Nguyen Binh Khiem street, in a small alley. You will see 2 houses full of customers and a busy kitchen in front of one house. You have many choices for sellfish here, even for some kinds of sellfish you cannot find in other places. The sellfish is fresh, good taste especially the once with butter and garlic; you can enjoy the sauce with toast. The oyster with cheese is nice, the cheese is smooth with fresh oyster. Recommend the steam fried glory morning with sellfish as well. Free motobike parking is one plus point. The staffs are nice and helpful, the food is served really quick.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 29, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
