            "review_text": "Kevyn S\n51 contributions\n0\nSeafood Shellfish that will Blow you Away\nJun 2015 • Friends\nYou can never stumble into a place like Oc Khanh. There has to be a moment when you get that key referral or recommendation. Thankfully I buddied-up with a local and now I hit this place 1x/week.\n\nFirst, the octopus is off the charts. Second everything is off the charts - snails, clams, prawns - it's all so darn good. Last, you don't have to mortgage your home to pay the bill. Just eat. Order more. Eat more. Drink ba ba ba. Order and eat more. The bill will be very resonable. \n\nYou can find this place off of a tiny alley that winds a little as you go continue down the street. Don't be turned off by the tiny plastic stools. \n\nIf you are looking for a reprieve from soup and rice, and are graving that seafood indulgence, this is the place for you. You won't be disappointed. Enjoy.\nk-\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 18, 2015",
